"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5356080","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3556510-1846018067936598","game_id":"steam-3556510","kind":"update","title":"DEEP SIX Demo Update Cycle and Bug Spotting","summary":"Looking for bugs...If you're here you likely know the DEEP SIX demo is finally live and folks are able to sink their teeth in and try it out for the first time since it was announced. What you may or may not know is this is a solo dev project. There is one of me, handling all the whole QA process, updates and patching. That means, unfortunately you are also part of the QA process! Sharing bugs, or issues will be the lifeline of quality for this project. So please, comment here, on any of the soc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T16:01:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936598","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3556510-1844751498233098","game_id":"steam-3556510","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo Teaser footage","summary":"Finally a new gameplay trailer to show of the state of development for the upcoming demo.I'm happy to finally share some bigger news about the upcoming demo and share the new looks and styling that has developed over this past year.NEW GAMEPLAY:Last gameplay footage featured core gameplay around weapons and radar types. During testing, I found the most fun was had in the scrounging for gear, looking for new items, looting and exploring, rather than the stealth action all on its own. This left me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T04:08:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3556510-1811772772449245","game_id":"steam-3556510","kind":"announcement","title":"New Beta Gameplay Footage!","summary":"Every year Godot showcases games made in their engine. This year Deep Six was submitted with the following game play footage. It can't show all the features in the time frame of 2-3 minutes but we packed in as much core content and mechanics as possible. Enjoy the new sneak peak but note this is all alpha/beta. Visuals, animations, game mechanics are still very much subject to change as the development continues. Enjoy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-01T17:35:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772449245","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3556510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3556510":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3556510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:15Z"},"5356080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3556510","app_id":3556510,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"425b654d7610b15c757263f8f1fbcca71084fa2370605bcfb48631bf55f48363","response_sha256":null,"so